{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20049","headline":"大隐坊 章仇将军良弃功守贫 · 孟郊","name":"大隐坊 章仇将军良弃功守贫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"饮君江海心，讵能辨浅深。\n挹君山岳德，谁能齐嶔岑。\n东海精爲月，西岳气凝金。\n进则万景昼，退则羣物阴。\n我欲荐此言，天门峻沈沈。\n风飙亦感激，爲我飕飀吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20049.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20049","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}